[32.465876, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m  7 ─ OpenClaw Agent Demo (Memory + LLM)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.466125, "o", "\u001b[1;36m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;32m▸\u001b[0m Running OpenClaw agent with a question that requires memory search.\r\n\u001b[1;32m▸\u001b[0m The agent will:\r\n\u001b[1;32m▸\u001b[0m   1. Call memory_search → Semantic Router vector store API\r\n\u001b[1;32m▸\u001b[0m   2. Get relevant docs from runbook.md & project-notes.md\r\n\u001b[1;32m▸\u001b[0m   3. Call LLM → Envoy → Semantic Router → vLLM\r\n\u001b[1;32m▸\u001b[0m   4. Return an answer grounded in workspace knowledge\r\n\r\n\u001b[1;33mQuestion: \"Search your memory for the incident runbook. What are\r\nthe exact steps for database connection pool exhaustion? Who is\r\nthe DevOps contact in project notes?\"\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[32.46616, "o", "\u001b[1;32m▸\u001b[0m Running agent...\r\n\r\n"]
[46.254002, "o", "Based on the information retrieved from your memory:\r\n\r\n### Steps for Handling Database Connection Pool Exhaustion:\r\n1. **Check current connections**: Run the SQL query `SELECT count(*) FROM pg_stat_activity;`\r\n2. **Kill idle connections older than 10 minutes**: Execute the following SQL command:\r\n   ```sql\r\n   SELECT pg_terminate_backend(pid) FROM pg_stat_activity\r\n   WHERE state = 'idle' AND query_start < now() - interval '10 minutes';\r\n   ```\r\n3. **Increase `max_connections` if necessary**: If the issue persists, increase the `max_connections` parameter in the PostgreSQL configuration and restart the database server.\r\n\r\n### DevOps Contact:\r\nThe DevOps contact listed in the project notes is:\r\n- **Charlie**: `charlie@example.com`\r\n\r\nIf you need further assistance, Charlie is the best point of contact for DevOps-related issues.\r\n"]
[48.255332, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;33m── Agent Metadata ──\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[48.257581, "o", "{\r\n  \"provider\": \"semantic-router\",\r\n  \"model\": \"Qwen/Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\",\r\n  \"duration_ms\": 12505,\r\n  \"input_tokens\": 14211,\r\n  \"output_tokens\": 177\r\n}\r\n"]
[51.258978, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m  8 ─ Architecture Summary\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mData Flow:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\n  │                   OpenClaw Agent                         │\r\n  │              (container, port 18788)                     │\r\n  └──────┬───────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┘\r\n         │                               │\r\n         │ memory_search tool            │ LLM inference\r\n         ▼                               ▼\r\n  ┌──────────────────┐          ┌──────────────────┐\r\n  │ Semantic Router  │          │      Envoy       │\r\n  │   API :8080      │          │     :8801        │\r\n  │                  │          └────────┬─────────┘\r\n  │  /v1/vector_     │                   │ ext_proc gRPC\r\n  │   stores/search  │                   ▼\r\n  │                  │          ┌──────────────────┐\r\n  │  mmbert embed    │          │ Semantic Router  │\r\n  │  in-memory store │          │  ExtProc :50051  │\r\n  └──────────────────┘          └────────┬─────────┘\r\n                                         │ model routing\r\n                                         ▼\r\n                                ┌──────────────────┐\r\n                                │      vLLM        │\r\n                                │     :8100        │\r\n                                │ Qwen2.5-14B-Inst │\r\n                                │ 32k ctx + tools  │\r\n                                └──────────────────┘\r\n\r\n"]
[54.259981, "o", "\u001b[1;32m\u001b[1m✓ Demo complete!\u001b[0m Both LLM inference and vector memory are served\r\n  by the semantic-router infrastructure.\r\n\r\n"]
